			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. P.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Quod a multis diebus nihil a me acceperis <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>nec tuis responderim, excuses me, rogo; scis <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>enim, in hoc bellorum tumultu quibus <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>occupationibus detinear.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Scripsit mihi <lb xml:id="p1z5"/><persName ref="p3375">Vergerius</persName> noster misitque pro te ea, que hic <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>reperies.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Novi aliud nihil habeo <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>ex <placeName ref="l822">Germania</placeName>, nisi quod <persName>Caesar</persName> omnino <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>cogitat de filio in <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> et <placeName ref="l822">Germania</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>promovendo; expectatur singulis horis <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>in <placeName ref="l640">Flandria</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Comitia sunt dilata, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>ut scis, credo; principes nobis <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>multa de sua constantia promittunt, utinam <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>ita sit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Sed cum videam illos capite <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>et nervis belli carere, timeo tecum <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>illorum tam frequentes conventus<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Apud nos arma ubique et spes in... <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ille... fuit cum rege pro <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>pace vel induciis impetrandis; sed <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>statim sensimus Caesaris artes; ita re <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>infetca remisus et iam est in <lb xml:id="p1z22"/><placeName ref="l640">Flandria</placeName> cum suo Caesare, qui ei <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>papatum promittit.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluto dominos et te <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>unice.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, vir optime.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Ex <placeName ref="l760">Soloturo</placeName> 2<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>4a ap[rilis].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Tuus s<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>emper <lb xml:id="p1z28"/><persName ref="p8296">Basse<pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/>fontaneus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Optimo viro d<lb xml:id="p4z2"/>omino <persName ref="p495">Bulingero</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p4z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
